178009886707352184_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBe5nMOa1VYQ7kNvwE4R9Q4&_nc_oc=Admvj7don9ff6-nYZT20hwkTuCg-DE4t9gofQ0RNCEXTerJ5qpcDnF-LqDiyl_5c3TM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuo3QC-LW3ombtQxZYFFDPE_lard3fsIhFLZkPgSCUalw&oe=699AE8DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TaskTitan_2560x1440.png", "id": "318678027752199", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982572_318678031085532_2872445775829117351_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8r7q1ihPcXgQ7kNvwHZMSpq&_nc_oc=Adn7M4DEnJ1R-kJfaq6hmb71KNf1LvCPgD9Vrtn08GQkfXP8hXjxVMrMbWAA-mKth00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGhBKnr61iHnEvyHu6hIEB8PchlXJeFCYi_jMCzEBVtg&oe=699B0DB0"}, "display_name": "Task Titans", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Task Titans is a series of 3 virtual reality mini games intended to teach the player project management concepts. \n\nDefeat Gremlins:\nOvercome risks and issues by battling gremlins, enhancing your problem-solving skills.\n\nBridge Building: \nConstruct one of multiples bridges types,  applying project management principles to ensure success.\n\nResource Management & Team Coordination:\nManage resources wisely and work with a team to bring your bridge project to completion.\n\nLearn Valuable Life Skills:\nGain insights into leadership, teamwork, strategic planning, and adaptability through real-life project scenarios.\n \nExperience:\nWhether a beginner or a seasoned pro, \"The Task Titans\" offers a fun and educational way to sharpen your project management skills.", "short_description": "Jump into the role of a project manager in \"The Task Titans,\" where you'll tackle various challenges from saving spaceships to constructing bridges and solving treasure maps."}]}, "developer_name": "START", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://taleoconnects.com/privacypolicy-tasktitans", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taleo", "su